<title>USA: China Tire 1996 oper net rises.</title>
<headline>China Tire 1996 oper net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper income		  13,100		    8,000</p>
<p> Consolidated net	    1,800		    2,700</p>
<p> Consolidated sales	320,600		  293,900</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is China Tire Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Audited consolidated earnings for the year ended December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>Company translated its figures from Renminbi to U.S. dollar using the unified exchange rate quoted by the People's Bank of China on December 31, 1996 at $1 to Rmb8.29.</p>
</text>
